  "description": "Drawing Captcha is an innovative and engaging software designed to verify human users through interactive drawing tasks. 🖌️ Users are prompted to complete specific patterns or color in logos on a grid, ensuring a secure 🔒 and enjoyable 😊 verification process. This unique approach not only enhances security but also promotes brand awareness by incorporating recognizable brand elements into the captchas.",
